        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana P311, 6-1/2\" Adjustable Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative cabinet pull features an adjustable mounting center for easy installation on cabinet doors or drawers that have existing holes. The modern design of the 6-1/2 Inch Adjustable Cabinet Pull comes from its sleek lines and stylish shapes. Available in your choice of 8 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-P311-size.gif?v=1704354527\" width=\"567\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana P311 Adjustable Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in shorter length:  <a href=\"/products/4-3-4-inch-adjustable-cabinet-pull-deltana-p310\"><b>Deltana P310 Adjustable Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>How to adjust cabinet pull without scratching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n1. Unscrew the base completely.\r\n<br>\r\n2. Remove the slotted screw to loosen round ring / clamp.\r\n<br>\r\n3. Adjust ring / clamp to required width position.\r\n<br>\r\n4. Replace and tighten screw.\r\n<br>\r\n5. Replace base. You're done!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana P311 Adjustable Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: Maximum 6\", Adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/P311.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  P311 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
