                "description": "6-1/2 Inch Adjustable Cabinet Pull Deltana P311 - This decorative cabinet pull features an adjustable mounting center for easy installation on cabinet doors or drawers that have existing holes. The modern design of the 6-1/2 Inch Adjustable Cabinet Pull comes from its sleek lines and stylish shapes. Available in your choice of 8 different finish colors.",
